WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.329 --> 00:00:03.088
- (crowd) Five, four, three, two--

00:00:03.088 --> 00:00:06.005
(triumphant music)

00:00:07.987 --> 00:00:10.596
- I've always loved the Nathan's
Hot Dog Eating Contest,

00:00:10.596 --> 00:00:13.522
as a kid, I always used to wake up early

00:00:13.522 --> 00:00:17.057
on the 4th of July to
watch seemingly normal

00:00:17.057 --> 00:00:20.390
human beings devour
40, 50, 60 hot dogs.

00:00:22.149 --> 00:00:23.993
I was transfixed.

00:00:23.993 --> 00:00:26.989
It's such a simple thing
to see how many hot dogs

00:00:26.989 --> 00:00:28.500
you can eat and it's so American and it's

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:31.394
something that I've always wanted to try.

00:00:31.394 --> 00:00:34.053
So, I just found out
I'm going to be in the

00:00:34.053 --> 00:00:38.529
Nathan's qualifier for the
Hot Dog Eating Competition.

00:00:38.529 --> 00:00:41.886
On the surface, I have no
place in this competition

00:00:41.886 --> 00:00:43.523
and I just want to see if I can

00:00:43.523 --> 00:00:45.553
put up a respectable number,

00:00:45.553 --> 00:00:48.099
10 hot dogs in 10 minutes.

00:00:48.099 --> 00:00:48.932
- [Voiceover] Is Nathan's
paying you for this?

00:00:48.932 --> 00:00:51.608
- Nathan's is not paying
me for this (laughs).

00:00:51.608 --> 00:00:53.525
I just want to do this.

00:00:54.777 --> 00:00:56.495
(playful music)

00:00:56.495 --> 00:00:58.311
This is where champions are made.

00:00:58.311 --> 00:01:01.088
I'm relatively confident in my goals.

00:01:01.088 --> 00:01:03.353
I can't really train-train

00:01:03.353 --> 00:01:04.578
like these competitive eaters

00:01:04.578 --> 00:01:05.972
that, like, stretch their stomach,

00:01:05.972 --> 00:01:08.075
it just doesn't seem healthy at all,

00:01:08.075 --> 00:01:09.682
especially for a novice.

00:01:09.682 --> 00:01:11.056
So, I'm just gonna eat hot dogs

00:01:11.056 --> 00:01:12.530
at every opportunity.

00:01:12.530 --> 00:01:13.363
Cheers.

00:01:16.417 --> 00:01:19.365
(playful music)

00:01:19.365 --> 00:01:22.052
Well,if I would normally
order one hot dog,

00:01:22.052 --> 00:01:23.204
I'd order three or four now.

00:01:23.204 --> 00:01:25.954
A casual trip to the supermarket,

00:01:26.843 --> 00:01:29.089
buying enough hot dogs
for a family of ten.

00:01:29.089 --> 00:01:30.643
I have to pick up my pace.

00:01:30.643 --> 00:01:31.736
I'm up to four hot dogs.

00:01:31.736 --> 00:01:33.734
I'm eating them pretty fast.

00:01:33.734 --> 00:01:38.212
I spent a lot of the
work day in the bathroom.

00:01:38.212 --> 00:01:39.492
- [Voiceover] Is Matt here?

00:01:39.492 --> 00:01:41.682
- What I'm starting to think about is--

00:01:41.682 --> 00:01:43.465
Forgot the buns.

00:01:43.465 --> 00:01:44.382
- -the buns.

00:01:45.789 --> 00:01:47.189
It's a lot of bread.

00:01:47.189 --> 00:01:48.955
What the top competitors do,

00:01:48.955 --> 00:01:51.320
they'll take the buns and
they'll soak it in water

00:01:51.320 --> 00:01:52.397
and they just eat it.

00:01:52.397 --> 00:01:54.314
It looks really simple.

00:01:55.352 --> 00:01:56.185
Ugh.

00:01:57.969 --> 00:01:59.289
This is the shitty part.

00:01:59.289 --> 00:02:00.772
I did the dipping of the bun in

00:02:00.772 --> 00:02:03.472
water for the first time and--

00:02:03.472 --> 00:02:04.422
Ugh.

00:02:04.422 --> 00:02:06.088
It was easily one of the most disgusting

00:02:06.088 --> 00:02:08.021
things that's every hit my palate.

00:02:08.021 --> 00:02:12.111
Every part, every inch
of my body was revolting

00:02:12.111 --> 00:02:14.057
against the entire idea.

00:02:14.057 --> 00:02:15.424
Ugh.

00:02:15.424 --> 00:02:16.985
It's gonna be a problem.

00:02:16.985 --> 00:02:20.344
The whole bun situation
really has me pretty down.

00:02:20.344 --> 00:02:22.439
My friend's coming now.

00:02:22.439 --> 00:02:24.570
My dad's gonna be there.

00:02:24.570 --> 00:02:29.060
I really need something
to pick up my spirits.

00:02:29.060 --> 00:02:33.150
So, I decided, I'm
gonna go to Coney Island.

00:02:33.150 --> 00:02:34.378
Go to the first Nathan's.

00:02:34.378 --> 00:02:36.628
Go where the champions eat.

00:02:37.843 --> 00:02:39.239
I remember what it was like again

00:02:39.239 --> 00:02:43.008
to enjoy the hot dog, before
all this, and it was great.

00:02:43.008 --> 00:02:45.925
(children playing)

00:02:47.447 --> 00:02:48.987
I think I'm ready.

00:02:48.987 --> 00:02:51.654
(hip hop music)

00:03:00.074 --> 00:03:01.586
- Yeah, what size shirt.

00:03:01.586 --> 00:03:05.336
- Uh, medium, yeah a
medium is probably fine.

00:03:07.458 --> 00:03:10.446
(crowd cheering)

00:03:10.446 --> 00:03:12.619
I'm the only person I think
who brought a cheering section.

00:03:12.619 --> 00:03:15.153
- The boys have to over-under at 7 1/2.

00:03:15.153 --> 00:03:16.796
- I think they're half supporting me,

00:03:16.796 --> 00:03:19.430
half waiting to see if I throw up.

00:03:19.430 --> 00:03:21.280
- Matthew, right here, buddy.

00:03:21.280 --> 00:03:23.882
You know I'm going to put you right here.

00:03:23.882 --> 00:03:25.848
(crowd cheers)

00:03:25.848 --> 00:03:26.681
- (crowd) Seven, six, five,

00:03:26.681 --> 00:03:28.514
four, three, two, one,

00:03:32.030 --> 00:03:35.363
(classical music plays)

00:03:45.426 --> 00:03:48.009
(crowd cheers)

00:04:08.022 --> 00:04:09.218
- Kiebus!

00:04:09.218 --> 00:04:12.138
- (crowd) Kiebus, Kiebus, Kiebus

00:04:12.138 --> 00:04:14.683
- I'm about to vomit,
I feel my gag reflex

00:04:14.683 --> 00:04:18.144
just (gagging sound).

00:04:18.144 --> 00:04:22.065
The seventh hot dog, two
and a half minutes left

00:04:22.065 --> 00:04:25.692
and there's no way I'm going to get to 10.

00:04:25.692 --> 00:04:29.036
My friend's said the over-under
at 7 1/2 hot dogs,

00:04:29.036 --> 00:04:32.186
all I have in my mind
now is getting to eight.

00:04:32.186 --> 00:04:34.330
There's 30 seconds left, the only way

00:04:34.330 --> 00:04:36.036
I'm going to get the over-under

00:04:36.036 --> 00:04:38.544
is if I soak the bun harder than I've ever

00:04:38.544 --> 00:04:40.275
soaked a bun before.

00:04:40.275 --> 00:04:42.364
I just dip is fully in that like,

00:04:42.364 --> 00:04:45.697
32 ounce cup, and I just try to shove it

00:04:46.676 --> 00:04:48.649
as far in my mouth as I can.

00:04:48.649 --> 00:04:52.086
- [Voiceover] Stop eating,
what's in your mouth counts.

00:04:52.086 --> 00:04:54.627
- And, I got it down.

00:04:54.627 --> 00:04:56.960
- He lost and he lost badly.

00:04:58.044 --> 00:04:59.562
Matthew the Stomach Kiebus with eight.

00:04:59.562 --> 00:05:00.771
(crowd cheering)

00:05:00.771 --> 00:05:02.182
- He got the over.

00:05:02.182 --> 00:05:03.599
- I got the over.

00:05:04.621 --> 00:05:07.434
Oh, I feel like garbage.

00:05:07.434 --> 00:05:09.319
I feel pretty bad.

00:05:09.319 --> 00:05:11.536
(triumphant music)

00:05:11.536 --> 00:05:13.035
I'm happy I did it,

00:05:13.035 --> 00:05:17.136
but it's not something
that I wanna do again.

00:05:17.136 --> 00:05:20.075
I could not respect
competitive eaters more

00:05:20.075 --> 00:05:22.555
than after this whole experience.

00:05:22.555 --> 00:05:26.180
You say to yourself, I can
do exactly what they can do.

00:05:26.180 --> 00:05:28.320
You can't, you just can't.

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:31.682
It's not possible, you can't do it.

00:05:31.682 --> 00:05:33.432
I learned first hand.

00:05:35.602 --> 00:05:36.435
(wind blows)

00:05:36.435 --> 00:05:39.018
(metal creaks)

